      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pony Realism\n\nPony Realism v2.2 (SDXL / Pony). Photoreal.\n\n- **Positive starts with** `score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up`.\n- **Negative starts with** `score_4, score_5, score_6`.\n- Danbooru tags. Say **female / male**, not woman / man. Keep weights at 1.5 or less.\n- 30+ steps, CFG 6-7, clip skip 2, over 1024 px.\n- **Samplers:** euler_ancestral (default), dpm_2_ancestral (most detail), dpmpp_2m_sde + karras. Avoid dpmpp_2m + karras.\n"
      ]
